# Regenerable diagnostics from `evaluate/scoreline_selection.py`. Deliberately
# not tracked: `models/manifest.json` embeds its content, so this file is only a
# transport. Committing it would let a stale copy ship as though it were current
# -- and a stale headline is worse than an absent one, which is why a retrain on
# a fresh checkout reports `walk_forward_status: not_computed` rather than
# inventing a figure.
models/selection_walk_forward.json
